### ===================================================================
### WASTING MONEY - LARAVEL REST API TESTING FILE (REST Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000/api
### Kredensial default lengkap tersimpan di: accounts.txt
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION (Kredensial Cepat & Fleksibel: Username / Email)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Login Admin (Pakai Username 'admin')
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Ambil token admin dari response login di atas
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3. Login Pengguna Figma (uccloud26)
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "uccloud26",
  "password": "user123"
}

@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Register Pengguna Baru (Sync ke Firebase Auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alex_turner",
  "email": "alex@arcticmonkeys.com",
  "password": "arctic123#Secure",
  "role": "user"
}

### 5. Cek Profil Pengguna (auth:sanctum)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### MERCH REQUEST SUBMISSIONS (User Flow)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Kirim Request Merch Baru (Format Mockup: Artist/Band, Type, Year, Edition)
POST {{baseUrl}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "artistBand": "Paramore",
  "merchType": "T-Shirt",
  "releasedYear": "2023",
  "merchEdition": "This Is Why Tour Limited Edition",
  "description": "Paramore Tour T-Shirt in washed charcoal black, size L",
  "additionalData": {
    "fileName": "paramore_tour.jpg"
  }
}

### 7. Riwayat Pengajuan User Sendiri
GET {{baseUrl}}/submissions/my
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### PUBLIC CATALOG (Card Items & Clean URL Slug)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8. List Seluruh Item Approved (Katalog Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items

### 9. Cari Item Berdasarkan Kata Kunci
GET {{baseUrl}}/items?q=taylor

### 10. Detail Item via Clean URL Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/taking-back-sunday-vinyl-1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### ADMIN MANAGEMENT (Approval Flow & Status Update)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 11. Daftar Seluruh Formulir Masuk (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. Update Status Pengajuan (In Progress / Approved / Rejected)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/submissions/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved",
  "adminNotes": "Barang telah ditemukan dari verified seller di Tokyo dan siap diproses."
}

### 13. Setujui Formulir (Approve -> Terbit Otomatis ke Katalog Publik)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/submissions/3/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "admin_notes": "Merchandise Radiohead Hoodie telah diverifikasi asli."
}

### 14. Tolak Formulir (Reject dengan Catatan Alasan)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/submissions/4/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "admin_notes": "Edisi vinyl ini sudah diskontinu permanen dan belum ditemukan seller terpercaya."
}
